      "updated": 1790714967718,
      "created": 1790714694674,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "System Design an OTT Platform (Netflix / Amazon Prime / Hotstar)",
      "fontSize": 38.00000000000002,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "System Design an OTT Platform (Netflix / Amazon Prime / Hotstar)",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "tjhe61bblyzrFC-d20CPZ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0.18939728438851944,
      "y": 2717.249369730644,
      "width": 1345,
      "height": 70,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b8R",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1777417106,
      "version": 293,
      "versionNonce": 849945618,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790714983285,
      "created": 1790714755292,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- An OTT platform is a service delivers digital content, like movies and TV shows, directly to\nconsumers via the internet",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- An OTT platform is a service delivers digital content, like movies and TV shows, directly to consumers via the internet",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "WKVOnUxMOopTyMUFbiiWy",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 12.18939728438852,
      "y": 2849.249369730644,
      "width": 608.1195068359375,
      "height": 200,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b8S",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2029883794,
      "version": 516,
      "versionNonce": 1648595677,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790725017972,
      "created": 1790714835378,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Functional Requirements\n- Users should able to create account and \n    opts for subscription (yearly/monthly)\n- Users should able to search and finds movies / shows based\n    on title or names\n- Users can watch videos in different \n  resolutions (480p, 720p , 1080p , 4k etc.)\n- Generate recommendation engine optional   ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Functional Requirements\n- Users should able to create account and \n    opts for subscription (yearly/monthly)\n- Users should able to search and finds movies / shows based\n    on title or names\n- Users can watch videos in different \n  resolutions (480p, 720p , 1080p , 4k etc.)\n- Generate recommendation engine optional   ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "Rd_KB8NbJsJtKGVxLIicX",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 697.9994863957166,
      "y": 2852.249369730644,
      "width": 710.3594970703125,
      "height": 125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b8T",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 353033746,
      "version": 500,
      "versionNonce": 1384159059,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790727523853,
      "created": 1790714862317,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2. Non - Functional Requirements\n- Scale : 200M users, 10K videos(~1 hours each)\n- CAP Theorem : High Availability Compare to >>> Consistency\n - Latency : Users should see the videos with zero or negligible buffering\n- Distributed and microservices architecture",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2. Non - Functional Requirements\n- Scale : 200M users, 10K videos(~1 hours each)\n- CAP Theorem : High Availability Compare to >>> Consistency\n - Latency : Users should see the videos with zero or negligible buffering\n- Distributed and microservices architecture",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
